# Idle (DECISIONS.md D38; Settings > Power "When unused for", "Then show"). Nothing touched for 15 minutes: the sleep
# screen comes and the device stays on (on USB; the simulator is), a tap brings back the launcher; a book (or a game)
# comes back by itself, after its own 30 minutes. With "Then show: Home" an unused app is left for the launcher.
wait 300
tap 100 424             # Mail tile
wait 890000
shot idle-before        # 14 min 50 s without a touch: still Mail
wait 12000
shot idle-sleep-screen  # 15 minutes: the sleep screen, by itself
tap 270 500             # a tap: the launcher (Mail is no book or game)
wait 1500
shot idle-woken
tap 100 248             # Read: the library (a book, for the idle check)
wait 1802000            # 30 minutes in the reader: the sleep screen
shot idle-read-sleep
tap 270 500             # a tap: the reader again
wait 1500
shot idle-read-back
back
wait 900
tap 270 424             # Settings
wait 900
tap 270 364             # Power
wait 900
shot idle-power-setting
tap 145 315             # Then show: Home
wait 900
back
wait 900
back
wait 900
tap 100 424             # Mail tile
wait 902000             # 15 minutes: back to the launcher, no sleep screen
shot idle-home-launcher
